  <div class="prose mt-10">
    <h2>Scope</h2>
    <p>
      The screens an agency CRM needs (inbox, reports, growth tools, team management) on web, phone and desktop,
      plus one section of our own, My Automations: Auto Post, Auto Story, Auto Mass, Auto-reply, Auto Funnel, Get to
      know fans and Gen-Info.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 items-start gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3">
    <section aria-labelledby="shipped" class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 ring-1 ring-black/10">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
        <h2 id="shipped" class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Shipped</h2>
        <span class="status-chip" data-status="Built">Built</span>
      </div>
      <div class="prose mt-4 text-base">
      <ul class="list-none space-y-0 divide-y divide-line pl-0">
        <li class="py-3"><strong>Dashboard</strong></li>
        <li class="py-3"><strong>Messages Pro:</strong> chat list, thread, fan insights, Split Inbox, pop-out chat windows, AI Copilot (the composer's AI button, on your own LLM key)</li>
        <li class="py-3"><strong>Analytics:</strong> Creator reports, Employee reports, Fan reports, Message dashboard, Sales records</li>
        <li class="py-3"><strong>Growth:</strong> Smart Messages, Smart lists, Auto-follow, Profile promotion, Free trial links, Tracking links, Vault Pro, Scripts, Sensitive words</li>
        <li class="py-3"><strong>My Automations:</strong> Auto Post, Auto Story, Auto Mass, Auto-reply, Auto Funnel, Get to know fans, Gen-Info</li>
        <li class="py-3"><strong>Share for Share:</strong> Discover creators, Requests, S4S schedule, S4S settings</li>
        <li class="py-3"><strong>Creators:</strong> Manage creators, Custom proxy</li>
        <li class="py-3"><strong>Employees:</strong> Manage employees, Organization Chart, Shift schedule, time tracking</li>
        <li class="py-3"><strong>Settings:</strong> Your Account to About Inflowwww, including custom roles and 2FA</li>
        <li class="py-3"><strong>Help center</strong> inside the app, with a help bot</li>
        <li class="py-3"><strong>Sign-in rate limits</strong> for owners and chatters</li>
        <li class="py-3"><strong>Surfaces:</strong> the responsive web app for phones, and the Electron desktop shell (see <a href="{{ '/download/' | url }}">Download</a>)</li>
      </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section aria-labelledby="planned" class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 ring-1 ring-black/10">
